    "title": "WrestleMania 42 match card. What time does Wrestlemania start",
    "text": "Updated April 18, 2026, 6:56 p.m. ETWrestleMania is here. Here's everything you need to know about today's show.When is WrestleMania 42?WrestleMania 42 will be held April 18 and 19.Where is WrestleMania 42?WrestleMania 42 will be held at Allegiant Stadium in Las Vegas.What time will WrestleMania 42 start?WrestleMania 42 is slated to start at 6 p.m. each night.Where to watch WrestleMania 42The first hour of each night of WrestleMania 42 will air on cable. On Saturday, the first hour of the show will air on ESPN 2. On Sunday, the first hour will air on ESPN. The entire card will air on ESPN Unlimited.Who is hosting WrestleMania?John Cena will host WrestleMania 42.Night 1 cardCody Rhodes vs. Randy Orton for the Undisputed ChampionshipStephanie Vaquer vs. Liv Morgan for the WWE Women's World ChampionshipThe Usos and LA Knight vs. Austin Theory, Logan Paul and IShowSpeedDrew McIntyre vs. Jacob Fatu, unsanctioned matchSeth Rollins vs. GuntherAJ Lee vs. Becky Lynch for the Women's Intercontinental ChampionshipNIa Jax and Lash Legend vs. Charlotte Flair and Alexa Bliss vs. Bayley and Lyra Valkyria vs. the Bella Twins for the WWE Women's Tag Team championship.Night 2 cardCM Punk vs. Roman Reigns for the World Heavyweight ChampionshipJade Cargill vs. Rhea Ripley for the WWE Women's ChampionshipBrock Lesnar vs. Oba FemiSami Zayn vs. Trick Williams for the United States ChampionshipPenta vs. Je'Von Evans vs. Dragon Lee vs. JD McDonagh vs. Rusev vs. Rey Mysterio in a ladder match for the WWE championshipFinn Balor vs. Dominik Mysterio",
